  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "All clear!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "You were right... This bunch came prepared!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "You guys should pick up the pace too!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "*gasp*... Just who are you people... *pant*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Everyone, please move faster!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Amiya, we're being pursued from behind.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Do we have time to counterattack?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Not at the moment...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "It's better to try to shake them off and avoid unnecessary battles...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Forget about the safety issue...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "I need a route that can get us out of the slums to Madam Ch'en as soon as possible.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Reunion is already on our trail...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "The more ground we have to cover, the more danger we'll be in!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "That's easy to do. I have a route here that the enemy will never think of.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Do you already have something in mind?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Of course~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "But I'll have to take a look myself first to see if my info is reliable or not.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Try to be quick about it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Got it~ Anyway, I'll be right back!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "If you need anything, please contact another Penguin Logistics agent!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Can I ask... where we're going?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We're meeting with the L.G.D.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "They will protect you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...the L.G.D.?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Our current mission is to safely escort you to the L.G.D., and they will provide you with protection.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I almost believed... that you were really here to save me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "No, we really are...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Our original plan was to ask Lungmen to entrust some of their Infected with us...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But after hearing our report, the L.G.D. suddenly asked us to transfer you to them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Besides... in Lungmen, you'll be safest under their protection.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "If we don't act now, you'll be in grave peril.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Many of the Infected that were coming after you were already wearing Reunion's badge...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I don't know anything about this 'Reunion' that you're talking about, but...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "But I do know the L.G.D., and I've seen how they treat the Infected. If you wanted me to capture me from the beginning, you should've just said it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'm sorry... But, that's really not our intention. I know there are still some misunderstandings that have to be worked out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But no matter how bad you think we are... Please, just bear with us a bit longer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Your safety takes priority over how you feel.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'll explain everything if I get the chance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "After all, there are still things that I want to know...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
